  <title><![CDATA[【新竹尖石｜達那露營區】我的滿分露營體驗，圓夢櫻花樹旁搭帳、遼闊草、，壯闊山景環繞｜首次體驗速搭帳－屋脊六（No.23）]]></title>
  <link>http://thedayisthelastday.com/2026/01/28/%e3%80%90%e6%96%b0%e7%ab%b9%e5%b0%96%e7%9f%b3%ef%bd%9c%e9%81%94%e9%82%a3%e9%9c%b2%e7%87%9f%e5%8d%80%e3%80%91%e6%88%91%e7%9a%84%e6%bb%bf%e5%88%86%e9%9c%b2%e7%87%9f%e9%ab%94%e9%a9%97%ef%bc%8c%e5%9c%93/</link>
  <pubDate>Wed, 28 Jan 2026 09:44:01 +0000</pubDate>
  <dc:creator>melody19961110</dc:creator>
  <guid isPermaLink="false">http://thedayisthelastday.com/?p=2562</guid>
  <description/>
  <content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:block {"ref":480} /-->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>📌 草地碎石營地，無提供護草墊<br>📌 園內種植多棵櫻花樹，櫻花季風景絕佳<br>📌 位處新竹尖石鄉，海拔約 1400 公尺<br>📌 寵物友善<br>📌 草地超級遼闊，適合大群人跑跳<br>📌 衛浴空間木頭裝潢，熱水穩定，但無提供蓮蓬頭<br>📌 360 度山景環繞<br>📌 1200/帳，採先到先選位<br>📌 露營日期：2025/02/28-2025/03/02</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:block {"ref":2365} /-->

<!-- wp:table -->
<figure class="wp-block-table"><table class="has-fixed-layout"><tbody><tr><td>-</td><td><strong>餐點</strong></td><td><strong>材料</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Day 1<br>早餐</strong></td><td>蘿蔔糕加蛋</td><td>蘿蔔糕<br>蛋</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Day 1<br>午餐</strong></td><td>1. 牛奶義大利麵<br>2. 番茄義大利麵</td><td>杏鮑菇、秀珍菇、洋蔥、義大利麵條<br>1. 牛奶、起司片<br>2. 番茄紅醬</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Day 1<br>晚餐</strong></td><td>牛肉水餃</td><td>略</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Day 2<br>早餐</strong></td><td>1. 小饅頭<br>2. 菇炒青江菜</td><td>略</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Day 2<br>午餐</strong></td><td>1. 煎豆腐<br>2. 蛋花湯</td><td>略</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Day 2<br>下午茶</strong></td><td>1. 烤玉米<br>2. 葡萄</td><td>略</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Day 2<br>晚餐</strong></td><td>1. 鮭魚菇菇炊飯<br>2. 烤雞肉串</td><td>1. 鮭魚洗淨、抹鹽後放置 40 分鐘。米（1）洗淨，少許醬油加上水總共（1），放上香菇、杏包菇靜置 30 分鐘。中火煮 5 分鐘，小火 15 分鐘，抹布悶煮飯神器靜置 15 分鐘。<br>2. 略</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Day 3<br>早餐</strong></td><td>1. 小饅頭<br>2. 蘿蔔糕加蛋</td><td>略</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>
<!-- /wp:table -->

<!-- wp:separator -->
<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity" />
<!-- /wp:separator -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>原本一直想訂櫻花營區，不過處處都滿位，當時放棄櫻花念頭，選擇了「達那露營區」。自從之前看到其他露友分享「達那露營區」遼闊草地和 360 度環繞的山景，這家露營區就一直存在在我的口袋名單裡。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>距離露營日期的前幾天，意外看到達那露營區竟然也有櫻花的消息，不過因為連續希望落空好幾回，所以一直到抵達前都是不敢抱太大期望。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|white"}}}},"backgroundColor":"medium-gray","textColor":"white","fontSize":"small"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-white-color has-medium-gray-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-small-font-size"><strong>路途遙遠的達那露營區，位置幾乎在北台灣的正中間，從新竹出發仍要將近兩小時。</strong></h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"10px"} -->
<div style="height:10px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>10：00 就開放入營，很符合我這種講求 CP 值的個性。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:media-text {"mediaId":2605,"mediaLink":"https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_6196/","mediaType":"image"} -->
<div class="wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6196.jpg?w=723" alt="達那露營區 入口" class="wp-image-2605 size-full" /></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content"><!-- wp:paragraph {"placeholder":"內容..."} -->
<p>超級喜歡達那露營區的入口設計，完全是我喜歡的模樣！</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>
<!-- /wp:media-text -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>一抵達營區，有種美夢終於成真的感覺，接近入口的區域開了滿滿櫻花，而往裡面走是營主說的景觀區，更是座落著兩棵又大又粉的櫻花樹，因為我們來得早，所以幸運的選在大棵櫻花樹旁。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery {"columns":2,"columnWidths":[["57.13032","42.86968"]],"ids":[2599,2602]} -->
<div class="wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular"><div class=""><div class="tiled-gallery__gallery"><div class="tiled-gallery__row"><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:57.13032%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="達那露營區 搭帳篷" data-height="2000" data-id="2599" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_5221-1/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5221-1.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5221-1.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 1 張圖片，共 2 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:42.86968%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="達那露營區草地" data-height="2000" data-id="2602" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/exported_901ecf33-969f-4fd5-a2a2-557595cb415d-1/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/exported_901ecf33-969f-4fd5-a2a2-557595cb415d-1.jpg?w=576" data-width="1125" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/exported_901ecf33-969f-4fd5-a2a2-557595cb415d-1.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 2 張圖片，共 2 張圖片" /></figure></div></div></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>我們算是第二組到的，所以草皮上還沒有停滿著車，這時候的看過去的草地真是很美，之前的露營經驗都未曾一次享有這麼大片草地。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|white"}}}},"backgroundColor":"medium-gray","textColor":"white","fontSize":"small"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-white-color has-medium-gray-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-small-font-size"><strong>很幸運的可以剛好擁有藍天和櫻花，再加上 360 度環讓的山景，整體風景如畫一般。</strong></h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:jetpack/wordads /-->

<!-- wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery {"columns":3,"columnWidths":[["36.35524","36.35524","27.28953"]],"ids":[2600,2598,2601]} -->
<div class="wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular"><div class=""><div class="tiled-gallery__gallery"><div class="tiled-gallery__row"><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:36.35524%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="達那露營區山景" data-height="2000" data-id="2600" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_5178/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5178.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5178.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 1 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:36.35524%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="達那露營區草皮" data-height="2000" data-id="2598" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_5182/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5182.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5182.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 2 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:27.28953%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="達那露營區草地" data-height="2000" data-id="2601" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/exported_599006bd-9599-43a8-8696-f64f6f6d9b04-1/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/exported_599006bd-9599-43a8-8696-f64f6f6d9b04-1.jpg?w=576" data-width="1125" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/exported_599006bd-9599-43a8-8696-f64f6f6d9b04-1.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 3 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div></div></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>前幾次露營都遇到寒流以及大霧，看到的景色都是灰灰白白的。這一次一開場就是藍天、粉色櫻花，讓我的心情一直都維持很好的狀態，不停地拍照紀錄，張張都好看。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>因為這次選擇好搭的屋脊六，即便這次沒有夜衝，我們也能悠閒的準備午餐。有別於剛開始露營的手忙腳亂，容易緊張兮兮的我已經越來越懂得好好放鬆。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery {"columns":3,"columnWidths":[["33.33333","33.33333","33.33333"]],"ids":[2614,2599,2612]} -->
<div class="wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular"><div class=""><div class="tiled-gallery__gallery"><div class="tiled-gallery__row"><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:33.33333%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="達那露營櫻花" data-height="2000" data-id="2614" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_5190-1/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5190-1.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5190-1.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 1 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:33.33333%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="達那露營區 搭帳篷" data-height="2000" data-id="2599" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_5221-1/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5221-1.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5221-1.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 2 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:33.33333%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="櫻花露營" data-height="2000" data-id="2612" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_5516-1/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5516-1.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5516-1.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 3 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div></div></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery -->

<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"10px"} -->
<div style="height:10px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|white"}}}},"backgroundColor":"medium-gray","textColor":"white","fontSize":"small"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-white-color has-medium-gray-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-small-font-size"><strong>這次減少很多複雜的料理，盡可能準備簡單的食物，把精力都放在享受大自然上面。</strong></h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"10px"} -->
<div style="height:10px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>早餐簡單的吃蘿蔔糕加蛋，讓肚子先免除飢餓後，就能慢慢嘗試我第一次的義大利麵！因為旅伴不能吃奶製品相關的食物，所以嘗試了一份白醬，一份紅醬的。求簡單方便，所以沒準備太多配料，想不到竟然兩個都是成功且好吃！義大利麵也比想像中來的方便。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery {"columns":3,"columnWidths":[["33.33333","33.33333","33.33333"]],"ids":[2590,2585,2578]} -->
<div class="wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular"><div class=""><div class="tiled-gallery__gallery"><div class="tiled-gallery__row"><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:33.33333%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="蘿蔔糕加蛋" data-height="2000" data-id="2590" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_5742/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5742.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5742.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 1 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:33.33333%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="露營 白醬義大利麵" data-height="2000" data-id="2585" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_5910/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5910.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5910.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 2 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:33.33333%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="露營美食 義大利麵" data-height="2000" data-id="2578" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_5996/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5996.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5996.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 3 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div></div></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery -->

<!-- wp:media-text {"mediaId":2587,"mediaLink":"https://thedayisthelastday.com/exported_dbeda2fb-3f43-4210-bfee-38a6b05cdc6e-1/","mediaType":"image"} -->
<div class="wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile"><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/exported_dbeda2fb-3f43-4210-bfee-38a6b05cdc6e-1-e1741007942226.jpg?w=723" alt="露營 烤玉米" class="wp-image-2587 size-full" /></figure><div class="wp-block-media-text__content"><!-- wp:paragraph {"placeholder":"內容..."} -->
<p>烤玉米幾乎要變成我們的固定行程，很適合當午後點心。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>
<!-- /wp:media-text -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|white"}}}},"backgroundColor":"medium-gray","textColor":"white","fontSize":"small"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-white-color has-medium-gray-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-small-font-size"><strong>遍佈空中的星星，與櫻花相互襯托著達那夜晚的景色</strong>。</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"10px"} -->
<div style="height:10px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>晚上被朋友呼喚，說著帳篷外的天空多美。雖然露營常常都有機會看到星星，但是達那露營區的天空看上去是特別寬廣、遼闊，加上是好天氣，所以星星是滿滿遍佈在天空中的。再搭配夜晚的櫻花，讓大家都忍不住頻頻讚嘆。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:jetpack/wordads {"format":"mobile_leaderboard"} /-->

<!-- wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery {"columns":3,"columnWidths":[["46.88876","53.11124"]],"ids":[2588,2591,2583]} -->
<div class="wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular"><div class=""><div class="tiled-gallery__gallery"><div class="tiled-gallery__row"><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:46.88876%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="達那露營區 櫻花夜景" data-height="1500" data-id="2588" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_6012/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6012.jpg?w=723" data-width="2000" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6012.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 1 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="達那露營區 星空" data-height="1500" data-id="2591" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_6017/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6017.jpg?w=723" data-width="2000" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6017.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 2 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:53.11124%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="櫻花露營 晚上" data-height="2000" data-id="2583" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_6023/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6023.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6023.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 3 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div></div></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery -->

<!-- wp:separator -->
<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity" />
<!-- /wp:separator -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>達那露營區的衛浴是男女分開，且洗澡間都無附蓮蓬頭，原本以為會洗澡很不方便，但是因為熱水非常穩定，所以洗澡體驗並不會感到不好。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>另外有附三個冰箱（冷凍＋冷藏）和飲水機，帳篷旁的洗手台也是貼心有超大檯面。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery {"columns":3,"columnWidths":[["33.33333","33.33333","33.33333"]],"ids":[2595,2593,2607]} -->
<div class="wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular"><div class=""><div class="tiled-gallery__gallery"><div class="tiled-gallery__row"><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:33.33333%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="達那露營區 廁所" data-height="2000" data-id="2595" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_5752/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5752.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5752.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 1 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:33.33333%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="達那露營區 廁所" data-height="2000" data-id="2593" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_5751/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5751.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5751.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 2 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:33.33333%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="達那露營區 洗手台" data-height="2000" data-id="2607" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_5912/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5912.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5912.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 3 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div></div></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>第二天早餐是蒸饅頭，之前買了煮飯神器後，也跟著買了蒸架，但是一直都沒用過。這次第一次嘗試也是大成功，第一次在營區吃到熱騰騰的饅頭，是很幸福的體驗。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:media-text {"mediaPosition":"right","mediaId":2575,"mediaLink":"https://thedayisthelastday.com/exported_70693f0b-27a4-4e80-aedb-10f1dae4bda3-1/","mediaType":"image"} -->
<div class="wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile"><div class="wp-block-media-text__content"><!-- wp:paragraph {"placeholder":"內容..."} -->
<p>不僅不需要油，也不需要使用很多廚具，免除洗碗的苦力，簡單就能完成的早餐，大概是也會被我們納入常態菜單了。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/exported_70693f0b-27a4-4e80-aedb-10f1dae4bda3-1-e1741008116730.jpg?w=723" alt="露營美食 小饅頭" class="wp-image-2575 size-full" /></figure></div>
<!-- /wp:media-text -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>除了邁向輕量化露營，也一直在學習隨心所欲，這次不是一直跟著原訂菜單走，而是想吃什麼，就煮什麼。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>發現原來這樣子隨性心情煮的東西成功率都比較高，也好吃。和旅伴一邊聊天，一邊不疾不徐地備料，把眼前的食材洗淨、切分。除了小饅頭，我們又煮了道簡單的菇炒青江菜。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:jetpack/wordads /-->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>以往都需要旅伴在一旁協助做菜，這次幾乎每一道菜都是自己獨自完成的。下午的煎豆腐也是大受好評，也是第一次煮湯沒有依賴康寶濃湯！</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery {"columns":3,"columnWidths":[["33.33333","33.33333","33.33333"]],"ids":[2581,2584,2576]} -->
<div class="wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular"><div class=""><div class="tiled-gallery__gallery"><div class="tiled-gallery__row"><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:33.33333%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="露營 炒青江菜" data-height="2000" data-id="2581" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_6185/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6185.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6185.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 1 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:33.33333%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="露營 煎豆腐" data-height="2000" data-id="2584" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_6325/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6325.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6325.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 2 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:33.33333%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="露營美食 蛋花湯" data-height="2000" data-id="2576" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_6326/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6326.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6326.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 3 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div></div></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery -->

<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"10px"} -->
<div style="height:10px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|white"}}}},"backgroundColor":"medium-gray","textColor":"white","fontSize":"small"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-white-color has-medium-gray-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-small-font-size"><strong>大草皮吸引很多小朋友、小動物聚集，在這聽到了很多童年的笑聲。</strong></h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"10px"} -->
<div style="height:10px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>這次還看到很了很多平常不會在營區見到的小動物，我們看到了兔子、貓咪、狐獴在同一時間都出現在了大草地上。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery {"columns":3,"columnWidths":[["35.85233","37.23500","26.91267"]],"ids":[2603,2623,2608]} -->
<div class="wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular"><div class=""><div class="tiled-gallery__gallery"><div class="tiled-gallery__row"><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:35.85233%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="達那露營區 草地" data-height="2000" data-id="2603" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_5889/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5889.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5889.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 1 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:37.23500%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="" data-height="2000" data-id="2623" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/exported_26eff663-390d-4580-8f96-c3d652c5a7bd-1/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/exported_26eff663-390d-4580-8f96-c3d652c5a7bd-1.jpg?w=723" data-width="1558" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/exported_26eff663-390d-4580-8f96-c3d652c5a7bd-1.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 2 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:26.91267%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="達那露營區 寵物友善" data-height="2000" data-id="2608" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/exported_03e286d7-fded-4e1d-a3fe-b5c665115fa7-1/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/exported_03e286d7-fded-4e1d-a3fe-b5c665115fa7-1.jpg?w=576" data-width="1125" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/exported_03e286d7-fded-4e1d-a3fe-b5c665115fa7-1.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 3 張圖片，共 3 張圖片" /></figure></div></div></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>每次都會小失敗的米飯料理，這次挑戰鮭魚炊飯成功啦！在達那露營區做的每件事情都意外地順利呢。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery {"columns":2,"columnWidths":[["51.77151","48.22849"]],"ids":[2579,2577]} -->
<div class="wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular"><div class=""><div class="tiled-gallery__gallery"><div class="tiled-gallery__row"><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:51.77151%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="露營 鮭魚炊飯" data-height="2000" data-id="2579" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_6363/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6363.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6363.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 1 張圖片，共 2 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:48.22849%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="露營美食 鮭魚炊飯" data-height="1546" data-id="2577" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/exported_cae85d0d-5cf9-4ce5-8bb8-e27142f0ed35-1/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/exported_cae85d0d-5cf9-4ce5-8bb8-e27142f0ed35-1-e1741008586953.jpg?w=715" data-width="1080" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/exported_cae85d0d-5cf9-4ce5-8bb8-e27142f0ed35-1-e1741008586953.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 2 張圖片，共 2 張圖片" /></figure></div></div></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>雖然白天幾乎和夏天一樣，穿短袖也沒問題。但畢竟是山上，早晚溫差很大，還是需要圍繞著焚火台取暖的。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>第二天晚上宵夜是常備菜單烤雞肉串，但這次卻意外地燙傷了我的嘴巴，鐵真的很燙！！使用鐵籤都需要多加留意！</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery {"columns":2,"columnWidths":[["50.00000","50.00000"]],"ids":[2582,2596]} -->
<div class="wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular"><div class=""><div class="tiled-gallery__gallery"><div class="tiled-gallery__row"><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:50.00000%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="露營 烤雞肉串" data-height="2000" data-id="2582" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_6373/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6373.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6373.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 1 張圖片，共 2 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:50.00000%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="露營 焚火台" data-height="2000" data-id="2596" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_6409-1/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6409-1.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6409-1.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 2 張圖片，共 2 張圖片" /></figure></div></div></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery -->

<!-- wp:separator -->
<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity" />
<!-- /wp:separator -->

<!-- wp:block {"ref":2361} /-->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>旅伴很怕冷，所以一直以來都不敢挑戰非一房一廳的帳篷，這次算是剛好賭對了，這週白天的氣溫幾乎和夏天一樣。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>我們這次選擇的是<strong>「屋脊六」</strong>，沒搭過速搭帳的我，對這個帳篷給很高的評價！第一次這麼輕鬆，即便不需要我的幫忙，旅伴也能在短短半小時內獨自搭完這個帳篷。不論是搭、收都很方便、快速。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery {"columns":2,"columnWidths":[["50.00000","50.00000"]],"ids":[2586,2611]} -->
<div class="wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular"><div class=""><div class="tiled-gallery__gallery"><div class="tiled-gallery__row"><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:50.00000%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="屋脊六" data-height="2000" data-id="2586" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_5299-1/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5299-1.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_5299-1.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 1 張圖片，共 2 張圖片" /></figure></div><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:50.00000%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="櫻花露營" data-height="2000" data-id="2611" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_6077/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6077.jpg?w=723" data-width="1500" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_6077.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 2 張圖片，共 2 張圖片" /></figure></div></div></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>不過另一方面，畢竟是速搭型的帳篷，遮光性、耐寒性當然都比不上之前租的一房一廳。而且也許是我們前庭搭法的關係，這幾天濕氣一直保留在帳篷內，頂布內側都是處於非常濕的狀態，人站起來一不小心頭就濕了，我和旅伴這幾天為此吹了很多次頭髮。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:jetpack/wordads {"format":"mobile_leaderboard"} /-->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|white"}}}},"backgroundColor":"medium-gray","textColor":"white","fontSize":"small"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-white-color has-medium-gray-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-small-font-size"><strong>屋脊六適合春天、夏天搭帳，可以享受三面風景，感受徐徐微風。</strong></h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:spacer {"height":"10px"} -->
<div style="height:10px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>但未來若是春、夏露營，應該還是有機會選擇這款帳篷，適合偶爾換換口味，享受三面風景，感受徐徐微風。重點是，真的方便好搭，不會讓我們搭帳篷搭到汗流浹背。也多虧了這次選擇這個帳篷，讓我們第一天就保留很多體力，這次露營很輕鬆～</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:separator -->
<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity" />
<!-- /wp:separator -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><strong>達那露營區－我的推薦指數 9.8 ⭐️</strong></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery {"columns":1,"columnWidths":[["100.00000"]],"ids":[2574]} -->
<div class="wp-block-jetpack-tiled-gallery aligncenter is-style-rectangular"><div class=""><div class="tiled-gallery__gallery"><div class="tiled-gallery__row"><div class="tiled-gallery__col" style="flex-basis:100.00000%"><figure class="tiled-gallery__item"><img alt="達那全景" data-height="622" data-id="2574" data-link="https://thedayisthelastday.com/img_8882/" data-url="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_8882.jpg?w=723" data-width="2000" src="https://thedayisthelastday.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/img_8882.jpg" role="button" aria-label="以全螢幕開啟第 1 張圖片，共 1 張圖片" /></figure></div></div></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:jetpack/tiled-gallery -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>接近滿分！除了我超級超級喜歡櫻花，也期盼很久以外。這裡的大草皮和山景真的讓人看了很舒服、放鬆。也想不到有什麼缺點，在這裡度過了很開心、幸福的週末。雖然路途很遙遠，但下次還會想來。</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

